*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~14 seconds<sup>300f~420f</sup>.
*5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 0.67~6 seconds<sup>20f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 32 seconds<sup>960f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
