**Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[H. Nah]]s spawn, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[H. Nah]] spawns.
