==Strategy==
Use [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]]/[[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and/or [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Legs Cat]] to mainly deal damage in this stage, as most of the enemies have strong close-ranged attacks. Along with them, use area-attacking cats such as [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO]] or [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|The Flying Cat]] as many of the enemies will spawn in heaps. Throughout the battle, spawn these units along with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] and stallers such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho]]. Bahamut should be able to cripple the H. Nah's while the Dragons/Legs damage Bun Bun Black.

Once Bun Bun is down, there should be an opening for the ranged attackers to hit the H. Nah's. However, you must be careful to protect Macho Legs, as he only outranges H. Nah by 6.

